### Implementation Details

The implementation follows the official Vercel documentation exactly:
- Analytics component imported from `@vercel/analytics/next` (correct path for Next.js)
- Component placed inside `<body>` tag in root layout (app/layout.tsx)
- Using the latest version 2.0.1 with enhanced features

### Next Steps for Deployment

To enable analytics on Vercel:
1. Deploy to Vercel using `vercel deploy`
2. Enable Web Analytics in Vercel dashboard under Analytics section
3. Verify by checking browser's Network tab for Fetch/XHR request from `/<unique-path>/view`
4. Monitor analytics data in the Vercel dashboard

